images/c/c2/Conjure_Elemental_Earth_Myrmidon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Earth_Myrmidon\" title=\"Conjure Elemental: Earth Myrmidon\">Conjure Elemental: Earth Myrmidon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Conjure Elemental: Fire Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Elemental: Fire Myrmidon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Myrmidon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Conjure Elemental: Fire Myrmidon\">Conjure Elemental: Fire Myrmidon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Conjure Elemental: Water Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Elemental: Water Myrmidon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Conjure_Elemental_Water_Myrmidon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Conjure Elemental: Water Myrmidon\">Conjure Elemental: Water Myrmidon</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> (Coast and Mountain)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> who choose the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocation\" title=\"Eldritch Invocation\">Eldritch Invocation</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minions_of_Chaos\" title=\"Minions of Chaos\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/30px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minions of Chaos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minions_of_Chaos\" title=\"Minions of Chaos\">Minions of Chaos</a> at level 9+ learn this spell.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Scroll of Conjure Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Scroll of Conjure Elemental\">Scroll of Conjure Elemental</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Each individual caster can have only one active summon from this spell at a time. Casting it again while an Elemental or Myrmidon is already summoned replaces the existing one.</li>\n<li>This spell is independent of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/30px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\">Conjure Minor Elemental</a>. The same caster can have one instance of an Elemental or Myrmidon and a Minor Elemental active simultaneously.</li>\n<li>The scroll version of the spell is cast at level 5 and as a result can only summon elementals and not myrmidons.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Conjure_elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Conjure_elemental\">Conjure elemental</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034410\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4636/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72301/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24926/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1700741/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.42%   85.951     52 Template:Trim\n100.00%   81.531      1 -total\n 96.84%   78.951      1 Template:Fe